    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d80-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d80-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, S/P–NSC Files: Lot 62 D 1, Soviet Satellites in
                    Eastern Europe. Top Secret.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d80-f2" n="2" xml:id="d80-f2-content">
                <p>Regarding NSC Action No. 1580, see <ref target="#d79-f9">footnote 9, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Supra</hi></ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d80-f3" n="3" xml:id="d80-f3-content">
                <p>Reference is presumably to NSC 5727, Supplement II (“U.S. Policy Toward East
                    Germany”), issued as an annex to NSC 5803, February 7, 1958.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d80-f4" n="4" xml:id="d80-f4-content">
                <p>NSC Action No. 1575 directed the Planning Board to prepare for NSC consideration
                    a supplement to NSC 160/1, “U.S. Policy Toward East Germany”, September 12,
                    1956. The supplement to NSC 160/1 is scheduled for publication in volume
                    XXVI.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d80-f5" n="5" xml:id="d80-f5-content">
                <p>Printed from a copy that bears this typed signature.</p>
            </note>
